    converted to ``float`` and, in row order, ``math.fsum`` computes
    ``W = sum(w_i)`` and ``S = sum(w_i * d_i)``; the result is
    ``S / W``. Overflow, invalid operations, or a non-finite value
    during the ``W`` summation, and ``W <= 0``, raise ValueError;
